  "sourceTitle": "Pear Relish",
  "sourceText": "Pear Relish\nBy: Melissa Peterman\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 gallon  Pears\n1 teaspoon Ground cloves\n1/2 gallon Onions\n4 pounds Sugar (8 cups)\n12 Green bell peppers\n1 quart Vinegar\n12 Red bell peppers\n1 tablespoon Celery seed\n1/2 cup Salt (or less)\n2 tablespoons Mustard seed\n1 teaspoon Dry mustard\n2 tablespoons Turmeric\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Grind pears, onions and bell peppers. Drain well in colander. Add remaining ingredients to drained mixture and bring to a boil. 2 Boil 7 minutes. Place in hot sterilized jars and seal while hot.",
